        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at small hydropower plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at small hydropower plant
Sources: Baumgartner &amp; Doka (1998), Konersmann &amp; Jean-Baptiste (2000).;
UUID: fcc4a324-b55c-3c58-9c7d-2fbc96cf4121
This dataset describes the production of electricity from an average small hydropower plant. Furthermore, the infrastructure and the potential energy of the water are included. Information about the consumption of lubricating oil as well as the land transformation and occupation is missing.
Location: Switzerland but also valid for Europe and other continents.
Technology: Average small hydropower plant. The average efficiency is 0.82. Annual production volume: 1.18GWh/a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fcc4a324-b55c-3c58-9c7d-2fbc96cf4121.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
